 HTTP fixture. Retain actual SDK response consumption, full object hashes, configuration readback, aggregate refresh-task coverage, failure receipts, and cleanup results. Keep production publication disabled.\n\nThe native preparation container now uses the host runner's explicit non-root UID/GID so private 0700 outputs remain readable and removable after the handoff. Invalid identities fail before Docker; existing native steps and resource limits are unchanged.\n\nValidation: independent Standards/Spec reviews; tests-first 18-case input regression and four repository contracts; real Linux tmpfs reproduction of the cross-UID failure and same-UID validation of 414 bound files; current native fixture 29/29 and native preparation 2/2 followed by SDK 20/20 on Mac. The first Linux CI failure is preserved; final Linux CI must pass for the updated head.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-22T17:53:32Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T18:39:59Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"7bb52a0d677c5349453c0004d73ffecf09ad47d6","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"No8blackball","id":17797708,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3Nzk3NzA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17797708?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/No8blackball","html_url":"https://github.com/No8blackball","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/No8blackball/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/No8blackball/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/No8blackball/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/No8blackball/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/No8blackball/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/No8blackball/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/No8blackball/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/No8blackball/events{/privacy}","received_events_url"